  "description": "Choi Geon-Woo has had a crush on Yoon Bo-Na since childhood. Finding it increasingly difficult to hide his feelings, he decides to confess to Bo-Na just before enlisting in the military, planning to run away if she rejects him… but to his surprise, Bo-Na accepts his feelings. Before long, the day of his enlistment approaches, and as Bo-Na ponders what kind of surprise to prepare for Geon-Woo… she recalls how he always called her his “bunny girlfriend” and decides to buy a “bunny girl costume.” However, the moment Bo-Na puts on the outfit, real rabbit ears and a tail sprout from her head, and when she finally reads the instruction manual, she finds a hint stating that rabbits have a strong sex drive…\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's Jipjungmaking Danpyeonseon (집중마킹 단편선) Collection.*",
